      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GEORGIE SUNSHINE (4) finished fourth last time but just a few runs back broke the clock when winning over 500m at this track, taking a Restricted WIN in a blistering 27.92. Should be in this for a long way. ONE MORE DRAM (1) has been a little hard to follow, missing the frame last time but was a Grade 5 winner three starts ago and has drawn 1 where he has won before. Expecting significant improvement. LOCO DOMINATOR (2) failed to feature last start after drifting back at Sandown, but prior to that won easily by 7 lengths at The Meadows (30.39) beating Reuben Hill in a Grade 5 on October 24. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. SOLAR SPECTRUM (7) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
